\", \"q\": \"Age-standardized prevalence of marijuana use by drinking patterns was also assessed by cigarette smoking status.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"* Age-standardized to the 2000 U.S. population unless otherwise noted.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"** Weighted to the Colorado population of noninstitutionalized adults.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}